WHEREAS, the Laramie County Board of County Commissioners reviewed the proposed
future land use map amendment and were given the opportunity to make comments; and

WHEREAS, a public hearing to receive public input and comments on the proposed
Future Land Use Plan and Transportation map amendment for the above described property was
held before the City of Cheyenne Planning Commission on February 22, 2022 and the Commission
approved the proposed Future Land Use Plan and Transportation map amendment; and

WHEREAS, Plan Amendment processes and procedures required by PlanCheyenne, as
amended, have been followed with regard to the request by Charles W. Bloom to amend the Future
Land Use Plan and Transportation map for the above-described properties.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING: that the City of Cheyenne Governing Body hereby
certifies Planning Commission action amending the Land Use Plan and Transportation Map for
PlanCheyenne as shown in Attachment A.

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the City adopts the Land Use Plan and
Transportation Map as the official land use and transportation plans of the City as a supplement to
the 2006 Parks and Recreation Master Plan, 2014 Cheyenne Area Master Plan Community Plan,
and 2020 Long Range Connect 2045 PlanCheyenne Transportation Update which are collectively
